  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your spinning throw is fast and you can use its momentum to quickly shift your position.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Spinning Throw<sup>UC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When using Spinning Throw, your bull rush combat maneuver is a free action, though you may use against a given creature only once per round. If your bull rush maneuver is successful, you can also move 5 feet. This movement does not provoke attacks of opportunity and does not count as a 5-foot step. In addition, you can affect creatures larger than your own size by expending one use of mythic power (or 1 point from your ki pool) per two size categories of difference (round up). If you target a creature your size or smaller with your Spinning Throw, you may expend one use of your mythic power after succeeding on your bull rush maneuver to push the target an additional 5 feet times your mythic tier.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-n-z-feats#toc91\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
